WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.100
Everyday objects already know how to move. We show them once.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:11.400
SAM separates the parts in the recording.

3
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:17.700
SAM 3D gives them shape. Muse helps describe how they connect.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.300
Our pipeline fits the movement and keeps its source evidence.

5
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.000
A twin becomes a readable object program.

6
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:40.500
Then use its parts and connections to prototype a robot task. Open the case. Move both earbuds to the tray. Close the case.

7
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Interaction Twin.

